    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more foreign countries; and  (b) the agreement deals with (among other things) the issue of orders (however described) by a competent authority (however described) of the foreign country, or each of the foreign countries, concerned.";
