    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits the use, recording or disclosure of protected information.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person uses, records or discloses information; and  (b) the information is protected information; and  (c) the use, recording or disclosure of the information is not permitted by this Part.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.";
